---
import {
  BUSINESS_LEGAL_NAME,
  BUSINESS_NAME,
  BUSINESS_VAT,
  BUSINESS_PHONE_DISPLAY,
  BUSINESS_EMAIL,
  BUSINESS_ADDRESS,
} from "@/lib/siteSchema";

const today = new Date().toLocaleDateString("it-IT", {
  day: "2-digit",
  month: "long",
  year: "numeric",
});
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <title>Contratto noleggio (vuoto) — GDIS Rent</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --line: #1f2937;
        --muted: #6b7280;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html, body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #f4f4f5;
        font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
        color: var(--line);
      }
      .toolbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        background: #fff;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      }
      .toolbar button, .toolbar a {
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 14px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #d4d4d8;
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--line);
        cursor: pointer;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .toolbar button.primary {
        background: hsl(240 100% 50%);
        color: #fff;
        border-color: hsl(240 100% 50%);
      }
      .sheet {
        max-width: 794px;
        margin: 24px auto;
        padding: 36px 40px;
        background: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
      header.doc-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
        padding-bottom: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }
      header.doc-header h1 {
        font-size: 20px;
        margin: 0 0 4px 0;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
      header.doc-header p {
        margin: 2px 0;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .meta {
        text-align: right;
        font-size: 11px;
      }
      h2.section-title {
        font-size: 13px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        margin: 20px 0 8px;
        padding-bottom: 4px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d8;
      }
      .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; }
      .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; }
      .field {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
      .field label {
        font-size: 10px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .field .line {
        height: 22px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .field.large .line { height: 44px; }
      table.grid {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }
      table.grid th, table.grid td {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 6px 8px;
        font-size: 11px;
        text-align: left;
        vertical-align: top;
      }
      table.grid th {
        background: #f4f4f5;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        font-size: 10px;
      }
      table.grid td .blank { display: block; min-height: 18px; }
      .terms {
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #374151;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      .terms ol { margin: 6px 0 0 18px; padding: 0; }
      .signatures {
        margin-top: 30px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }
      .sign-box .sign-line {
        height: 60px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .sign-box .sign-label {
        font-size: 10px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-top: 4px;
      }
      footer.doc-footer {
        margin-top: 26px;
        padding-top: 12px;
        border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d8;
        font-size: 9px;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
      }

      @media print {
        .toolbar { display: none; }
        body { background: #fff; }
        .sheet {
          margin: 0;
          padding: 18mm 16mm;
          box-shadow: none;
          max-width: none;
        }
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <button type="button" class="primary" onclick="window.print()">🖨 Stampa contratto</button>
      <a href="/admin">← Torna al pannello</a>
    </div>

    <article class="sheet">
      <header class="doc-header">
        <div>
          <h1>Contratto di noleggio</h1>
          <p><strong>{BUSINESS_NAME}</strong> — {BUSINESS_LEGAL_NAME}</p>
          <p>{BUSINESS_ADDRESS.streetAddress}, {BUSINESS_ADDRESS.postalCode} {BUSINESS_ADDRESS.addressLocality} ({BUSINESS_ADDRESS.addressRegion})</p>
          <p>P.IVA {BUSINESS_VAT} · Tel {BUSINESS_PHONE_DISPLAY} · {BUSINESS_EMAIL}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="meta">
          <p><strong>Contratto N°</strong> ____________</p>
          <p>Data: {today}</p>
          <p>Sede: ____________________</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <h2 class="section-title">Dati conducente principale</h2>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="field"><label>Cognome</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Nome</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Data di nascita</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Luogo di nascita</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Codice fiscale</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Documento (tipo / N°)</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Patente N°</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Scadenza patente</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field large"><label>Residenza completa</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Telefono</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Email</label><div class="line"></div></div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Secondo conducente (opzionale)</h2>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="field"><label>Cognome e nome</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Codice fiscale</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Patente N°</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Telefono</label><div class="line"></div></div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Veicolo</h2>
      <table class="grid">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Categoria</th>
            <th>Marca / Modello</th>
            <th>Targa</th>
            <th>Colore</th>
            <th>Carburante</th>
            <th>Km consegna</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="section-title">Periodo, luoghi, importi</h2>
      <table class="grid">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Ritiro — data</th>
            <th>Ritiro — ora</th>
            <th>Luogo ritiro</th>
            <th>Riconsegna — data</th>
            <th>Riconsegna — ora</th>
            <th>Luogo riconsegna</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <table class="grid" style="margin-top:8px">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Tariffa giornaliera</th>
            <th>Giorni</th>
            <th>Imponibile</th>
            <th>IVA</th>
            <th>Cauzione</th>
            <th>Totale</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
            <td><span class="blank"></span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="section-title">Stato veicolo alla consegna</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="field"><label>Livello carburante</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Pneumatici (stato)</label><div class="line"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Accessori consegnati</label><div class="line"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field large" style="margin-top:8px"><label>Note danni / graffi presenti</label><div class="line"></div></div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Condizioni di noleggio</h2>
      <div class="terms">
        <ol>
          <li>Il conducente dichiara di essere in possesso di patente di guida valida, di aver compiuto i 21 anni e di non aver subito sospensioni o ritiri.</li>
          <li>Il veicolo è consegnato in perfetto stato d'uso. Eventuali difformità rispetto alle "Note danni" sopra indicate sono a carico del conducente.</li>
          <li>Il conducente si impegna a riconsegnare il veicolo nello stesso stato e con il medesimo livello di carburante della consegna.</li>
          <li>È fatto divieto di trasporto di merci pericolose, partecipazione a competizioni, traino di altri veicoli e cessione del mezzo a terzi non autorizzati per iscritto.</li>
          <li>In caso di sinistro è obbligatoria la compilazione del modulo CAI e la comunicazione immediata al noleggiatore al numero {BUSINESS_PHONE_DISPLAY}.</li>
          <li>Le sanzioni amministrative e i relativi oneri di gestione sono a totale carico del conducente.</li>
          <li>Il foro competente per ogni controversia è quello di Tempio Pausania.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size:10px;margin-top:10px;">Ai sensi degli artt. 1341 e 1342 c.c. il conducente dichiara di approvare specificamente le clausole 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 e 7.</p>

      <div class="signatures">
        <div class="sign-box">
          <div class="sign-line"></div>
          <div class="sign-label">Firma del conducente principale</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sign-box">
          <div class="sign-line"></div>
          <div class="sign-label">Firma del noleggiatore (GDIS Rent)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="doc-footer">
        Documento generato dal pannello GDIS Rent · {today} · da compilare e firmare in originale.
      </footer>
    </article>
  </body>
</html>
